      <title locale="en">Do Deadlines Exist? Evidence from a Single Laboratory</title>
      <abstract locale="en">
        We attempted to observe a deadline directly and failed. We discuss whether deadlines
        are best modelled as physical objects, social constructs, or rumours, and conclude
        that further funding is required.
      </abstract>
