      <title locale="en">A Meta-Analysis of Meta-Analyses of Meta-Analyses</title>
      <abstract locale="en">
        Three levels of aggregation were applied to a literature that was itself entirely
        aggregate. The pooled effect size is reported with a confidence interval wide enough
        to contain both the hypothesis and its negation.
      </abstract>
